    "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Founding Directors and Members contributed to the Dojo before the doors ever opened.  Without them, Hacker Dojo would still just be an idea in David's head!\n</p>\n<pre>Founding Directors\n</pre>\n<ul><li>Kitt Hodsden</li>\n<li>Brian Klug</li>\n<li>David Weekly</li>\n<li>Jeff Lindsay</li>\n<li>Melissalynn Perkins</li></ul>\n<pre>Founding Members\n</pre>\n<ul><li>Adam Glickman</li>\n<li>Adam Smith</li>\n<li>Alison Chaiken</li>\n<li>Andrew Wooster</li>\n<li>Andy Smith</li>\n<li>Bill Ward</li>\n<li>Casey Greene</li>\n<li>Charles Merriam</li>\n<li>Chris Countryman</li>\n<li>Daniel Silveira</li>\n<li>David Mills</li>\n<li>Dean Mao</li>\n<li>Jason Abele</li>\n<li>Jason May</li>\n<li>Jesse Andrews</li>\n<li>Jon Hull</li>\n<li>Luke Crawford</li>\n<li>Martin Williams</li>\n<li>Matt Hancher</li>\n<li>Matt Stancliff</li>\n<li>Mike Lundy</li>\n<li>Nathan Schmidt</li>\n<li>Richard Kiss</li>\n<li>Rohit Khare</li>\n<li>Russ Fan</li>\n<li>Sam Odio</li>\n<li>Tim Fitz</li></ul>\n\n\n\n</div>"
