    "excerpt": "Hello! Thanks for checking out Hacker Dojo.📍 Hacker Dojo Location & Hours:855 Maude Avenue, Mountain View, CA 94043.Guest & Visitor Hours: 7 days a week, 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM. (Members have 24/7 access).Take a...",
