    "nexudus": null,
    "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\">\n<h2 id=\"community\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Community\">Community</span></h2>\n<p>Below are pages created by the community, volunteers and event organizers. \nIf you like to add your initiative here, please reach out as we will be ramping up this page more. \n</p><p>If you would like to join our Open Discord Community chat:\n<a class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.gg/aBBnguYCA5\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/aBBnguYCA5</a>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"ham\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"HAM\"><a class=\"wiki-internal-link\" href=\"#ham\" title=\"HAM\">HAM</a></span></h3>\n<p>Amateur Radio in and around Mt.View along with related topics\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"friday-night-socials\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Friday_Night_Socials\"><a class=\"wiki-internal-link\" href=\"#friday-night-socials\" title=\"Friday Night Socials (page does not exist)\">Friday Night Socials</a></span></h3>\n<p>Interested in helping host our Friday night socials, connect with one of our organizers and get the scoop here. \nIt's probably been our most popular event since rebooting out of the pandemic. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"music-corner\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Music_Corner\"><a class=\"wiki-internal-link\" href=\"#music-corner\" title=\"Music Corner (page does not exist)\">Music Corner</a></span></h3>\n<p>We have a bunch of instruments and controllers ready to rock out. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"meditation-sessions\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Meditation_Sessions\"><a class=\"wiki-internal-link\" href=\"#meditation-sessions\" title=\"Meditation Sessions (page does not exist)\">Meditation Sessions</a></span></h3>\n<p>Our meditation sessions are quick breaks in the day to help you focus and destress.\n</p>\n\n\n\n</div>"
